@startuml
title ShardPilot: configurable selection and frozen execution
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam activityBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ArrowColor #475569

start
if (Read-only downloaded profile snapshot?) then (worker)
  :Validate policy / E / history / count
Recompute decision from frozen changes;
  :Verify local HEAD and known clean checkout
No diff or fetch;
else (planner / single node)
  :Read Git at execution time for affected only
Explicit/CI base + exact HEAD + rename paths;
  :Bounded opt-in fetch or UNKNOWN
Dirty/missing history uses declared FULL/FAIL;
endif
:Immutable policy + profile\nFull eligibility E + changes + history;
:Validate parameters and every configured target;
if (Valid inputs / targets?) then (yes)
  :Resolve full / smoke / affected / explicit;
  :Union rules and mandatory families\nExpand within E only;
  if (Full mode, full rule or safe full fallback?) then (yes)
    :Select all E\nReport budget overflow without truncation;
  else (subset)
    :Reserve protected families;
    if (Protected budget exceeded with overflow=fail?) then (yes)
      :FAILED evidence;
      :No executable manifest / identity;
      stop
    else (no)
    endif
    :Pack optional families\nPriority, decimal cost, binary family name;
    :Explain deferred families\nApply declared empty-selection policy;
  endif
else (no)
  :FAILED evidence\nNo executable manifest / identity;
  stop
endif
if (Accepted nonempty plan after all declared fallbacks?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :FAILED evidence\nNo executable manifest / identity;
  stop
endif
:PASSED decision + E / S manifests\nPolicy hash + input identity + JSON / HTML;
:Freeze decision + Git provenance
Existing TestSelection / ShardPlan identities;
:Gradle / Maven native workers
All nodes consume the same frozen cohort;
:Artifact-only aggregation
No Git, producers or native rerun;
:Native execution outcomes and C2 evidence\nRemain independent of planning success;
stop
@enduml
